# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Installer leftovers
*.bak.sedna-stack.*
*.tmp
seed/*.partial

# Working data that must never be committed here.  This repository ships a *seed*
# (canonical, verified, sanitized).  A raw working tree is not a seed:
#   raw_src/     collected write-ups and notes -- the public titagram/sedna history
#                already shows what happens when these are committed: 66 files with
#                captured flags.  Never again.
#   engagements/ the append-only journals and their evidence blobs, which quote the
#                material that was found on target.
#   indexes/     the full-text index, rebuilt on demand from the canonical bundles.
raw_src/
engagements/
indexes/
retrieval.sqlite
*.ovpn
credentials*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
.DS_Store
